    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:0",
      "text": "Staging keys. The contractor who had access finished last week, so we rotate everything he could see."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:1",
      "text": "That's the payments sandbox key, the email provider key, and the two internal service tokens."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:2",
      "text": "Right. Mateo, can you rotate all four by Tuesday November 3rd, 17:00 UTC?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:3",
      "text": "Yes. Tuesday the 3rd, 17:00 UTC, all four."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:4",
      "text": "Done means the old keys are revoked at the provider, not just replaced, and the CI secrets are updated so the nightly build passes."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:5",
      "text": "Got it. Revoked at the provider, CI secrets updated, nightly green."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:6",
      "text": "I'll check the provider dashboards on Wednesday morning and confirm the old keys show as revoked."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:7",
      "text": "OK. I'll post in the infra channel as each one is done."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:8",
      "text": "Thanks. Production keys are out of scope. He never had access to those."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:9",
      "text": "Understood. Staging only."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:10",
      "text": "And if a rotation breaks something, roll forward. Don't restore the old key."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:11",
      "text": "Makes sense, the old ones will be revoked anyway."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-aligned-key-rotation:seg:12",
      "text": "Great. That's all I had."
    }
  ],
